    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94362" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῑτ-ίζω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσίτισα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					4.9
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, fut.
			
				Att.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιοῦμαι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				32.1
			</span></i>; 
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιεῦμαι </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.50
			</span></i>: aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσιτισάμην </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				50.53
			</span></i>: pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεσίτισμαι</span> (v.
				infr.):—<i>feed</i> an infant, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				716
			</span></i>, Mnesith. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				19.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					1.29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀλεκτρυόνας σκόροδα
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				4.9
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be fattened,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PCair.Zen.
				464.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτέομαι</span>
			, <i>eat</i>, c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῶκας σιτίζεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					4.16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				3.26
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἰσαῖον ὅλον
				σεσίτισται</span> (of Demosthenes), Pytheas ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Is.</u>
				4
			</span></i>.</div>
